        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/294902dcfedd2b9eecdcfe992c0712f2.avif?t=1766173749\" width=720 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DOG, AN ISLAND, AN UNFORGETTABLE ADVENTURE... AND A LOT OF PIZZA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unexpected shipwreck, Toni, a pizza-obsessed sailor dog, finds himself stranded on the mysterious Salamino Island – a place inhabited by dogs, where cats have been banned for generations. To get back home, he must explore every corner of the island, uncover ancient secrets, and face an erupting volcano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can Toni transform the island, currently in chaos, into a peaceful paradise?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/a723c57bab899b6e01c39987203c685b.poster.avif?t=1766173749\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/a723c57bab899b6e01c39987203c685b.webm?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/a723c57bab899b6e01c39987203c685b.mp4?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LIVING ISLAND TO EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salamino Island features <strong>five unique towns</strong>, each with its own distinct characteristics, architecture, and inhabitants. From coastal villages to a <strong>vibrant metropolis</strong>, each area holds its own culture, challenges, and secrets waiting to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/7a02c81a2bafd8570664ceae82b446d5.poster.avif?t=1766173749\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/7a02c81a2bafd8570664ceae82b446d5.webm?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/7a02c81a2bafd8570664ceae82b446d5.mp4?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SMART PUZZLE CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island's dungeons are filled with creative puzzles and boss battles that will keep you on your toes. Don't worry – these challenges are fun and engaging without taking up hours of your time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/0e7899614200f75ca1f219bba881e0f3.poster.avif?t=1766173749\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/0e7899614200f75ca1f219bba881e0f3.webm?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/0e7899614200f75ca1f219bba881e0f3.mp4?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADVENTURE BEYOND THE MAIN STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main quest, Toni can assist the local museum in completing its collections or decorate his beach cabin with found items. There’s always something new to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/5425032fba2f1535f44e51bb2e0f0208.poster.avif?t=1766173749\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/5425032fba2f1535f44e51bb2e0f0208.webm?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/5425032fba2f1535f44e51bb2e0f0208.mp4?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINIGAMES TO UNWIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the adventure with fun activities! Grab your surfboard for a relaxing minigame or take on a pizza delivery challenge to satisfy the islanders’ hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/53c5401fd4ae695073390430a13c393a.poster.avif?t=1766173749\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/53c5401fd4ae695073390430a13c393a.webm?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/53c5401fd4ae695073390430a13c393a.mp4?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASUAL COMBAT AND RELAXING GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While combat isn’t the main focus, Toni can battle enemies in a laid-back way to earn some extra cash and take a mental break between the puzzle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <strong>A true 8-bit experience</strong> reminiscent of classic handheld games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ <strong>Five towns</strong>, each with its own charm and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👾 Memorable characters with captivating stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 An engaging narrative with hidden secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Dungeons focused on puzzles and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Fun side quests and items to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 Minigames like surfing and pizza delivery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍕 <strong>Plenty of pizza</strong> for Toni to enjoy along the way!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/294902dcfedd2b9eecdcfe992c0712f2.avif?t=1766173749\" width=720 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DOG, AN ISLAND, AN UNFORGETTABLE ADVENTURE... AND A LOT OF PIZZA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unexpected shipwreck, Toni, a pizza-obsessed sailor dog, finds himself stranded on the mysterious Salamino Island – a place inhabited by dogs, where cats have been banned for generations. To get back home, he must explore every corner of the island, uncover ancient secrets, and face an erupting volcano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can Toni transform the island, currently in chaos, into a peaceful paradise?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/a723c57bab899b6e01c39987203c685b.poster.avif?t=1766173749\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/a723c57bab899b6e01c39987203c685b.webm?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908830/extras/a723c57bab899b6e01c39987203c685b.mp4?t=1766173749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LIVING ISLAND TO EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salamino Island features <strong>five unique towns</strong>, each with its own distinct characteristics, architecture, and inhabitants. From coastal villages to a <strong>vibrant metropolis</strong>, each area holds its own culture, challenges, and secrets waiting to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i