dheld games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ <strong>Five towns</strong>, each with its own charm and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👾 Memorable characters with captivating stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 An engaging narrative with hidden secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Dungeons focused on puzzles and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Fun side quests and items to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 Minigames like surfing and pizza delivery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍕 <strong>Plenty of pizza</strong> for Toni to enjoy along the way!</p></li></ul>",
